### SLA state is part of every issue (ON_TRACK, AT_RISK, BREACHED; MET or MISSED once resolved)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues?size=10

### Analytics, scoped to the signed-in user (Admin: city, Authority: department, Citizen: own reports)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A custom period (at most 366 days)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/analytics/summary?from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/analytics/trend?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/analytics/hotspots?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Open issues past their deadline, most overdue first
GET {{host}}/api/v1/analytics/overdue?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Surveys (Authority or Admin): find areas with several open issues
GET {{host}}/api/v1/surveys/clusters?radius=500&minIssues=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {% client.global.set("lat", response.body[0].centerLatitude); client.global.set("lng", response.body[0].centerLongitude); %}

### Create a survey for that area; everyone who reported an open issue there is invited
POST {{host}}/api/v1/surveys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Street lighting in your lane",
  "centerLatitude": {{lat}},
  "centerLongitude": {{lng}},
  "radiusMeters": 500,
  "closesAt": "2026-12-31T18:30:00Z",
  "questions": [
    { "text": "How safe does the lane feel at night?", "type": "RATING" },
    { "text": "Should more lights be added?", "type": "YES_NO" },
    { "text": "Anything else we should know?", "type": "TEXT" }
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("surveyId", response.body.id); %}

### Results (creator or Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/surveys/{{surveyId}}/results
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Citizens: surveys I am invited to
GET {{host}}/api/v1/surveys/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
